          "reason": "MR terms table (Platinum Card): \"All other spends: 1 MR point for every Rs. 40 spent\", telecommunications included; card page: \"1 Membership Reward points for every INR 40 spent\". The conditions only restated the exclusions, which are their own rows (insurance, utilities MCC 4900, cash, EMI; fuel has its own rule); the \"eligible_spend == true\" clause made the base rule info. A category list here would also exclude telecom bills, which earn.",
